-- one halving of [lo, hi] on the sign of F at the midpoint (F(lo) < 0 < F(hi) kept), with the starts' soundness
h2p-pick : Bool → BZ → BZ → BZ → Bool × IV → Bool × (BZ × BZ)
h2p-pick ok lo hi mid fm = (both ok (fst fm) , (if iv-neg-sure (snd fm) then (mid , hi) else (if iv-pos-sure (snd fm) then (lo , mid) else (lo , hi))))
